v100-thinkingcap-setup
Setup notes, patches and benchmarks for running ThinkingCap-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next NVFP4 on 4x V100 32GB.

Files under engine/ports/stage/ and engine/fly/ are modified copies of vLLM / 1Cat-vLLM source files
(Apache License 2.0, Copyright the vLLM project and 1CatAI contributors). Our changes are marked in the files
or described in README.md.

